  "steps": [
    {
      "number": 1,
      "id": "step-1",
      "heading": "Get ready",
      "blocks": [
        "Set out a casserole safe for both the hob and oven. If needed, start in a wide frying pan and transfer to an ovenproof dish. Wash the produce."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": []
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "id": "step-2",
      "heading": "Heat the oven and prep the garlic",
      "blocks": [
        "Preheat the oven to 220°C (200°C fan, gas 7). Boil half a kettle. Heat a drizzle of olive oil in the casserole over high heat. Crush the garlic cloves, peel and roughly chop."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [],
